sequenceDiagram
    participant FS as Local Filesystem
    participant C as Client Daemon
    participant S as Go Sync Server
    participant DB as Turso DB
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2

    Note over FS,C: Local change detected
    FS->>C: fsnotify event or reconcile output
    C->>C: RecordChange: upsert local_files and insert pending_operations

    Note over C,S: Periodic sync pass
    C->>C: buildManifest from local_files, rehash pending only
    C->>S: GetSyncPlan(local manifest)
    S->>DB: query files by path and head versions
    S-->>C: sync plan with UPLOAD and DOWNLOAD actions

    alt UPLOAD
        C->>S: UploadFile stream with meta and whole file bytes
        S->>R2: put uploads/file_id/version_id
        S->>DB: insert file_versions and set current_version
        S-->>C: UploadFileResponse
    else DOWNLOAD
        C->>S: DownloadFile(path)
        S->>R2: get head version bytes
        S-->>C: DownloadFileResponse with meta and data frames
        C->>C: write temp file then atomic rename
    end

    Note over C: Pending local edits always upload, never download
    C->>C: MarkAllCompleted